  "title": "Twice-Baked Sweet Potatoes with Ricotta Cheese",
  "description": "These ricotta sweet potatoes are the perfect blend of sweet and savory, baked twice and filled with blended sweet potatoes and ricotta cheese.",
  "authors": [
